{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/attributedstring\/writingdirection"]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Enumeration","symbolKind":"enum","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WritingDirection","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"FoundationEssentials"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:20FoundationEssentials16AttributedStringV16WritingDirectionO","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WritingDirection","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":[{"introducedAt":"26.0","name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"26.0","name":"iPadOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"26.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst"},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"name":"macOS","deprecated":false},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"26.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"tvOS"},{"introducedAt":"26.0","name":"visionOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"name":"watchOS","deprecated":false}],"extendedModule":"FoundationEssentials","title":"AttributedString.WritingDirection"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/leftToRight","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/rightToLeft"],"title":"Working with writing directions","anchor":"Working-with-writing-directions"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/init(from:)"],"title":"Encoding and decoding","anchor":"Encoding-and-decoding"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/Equatable-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/AttributeInvalidationCondition","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/UTF16View","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/UTF8View","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/AttributeRunBoundaries"],"title":"Supporting types","generated":true,"anchor":"Supporting-types"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"The writing direction of a piece of text.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s15BitwiseCopyableP","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s12CaseIterableP","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/Se","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/SE","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/SQ","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/SH","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WritingDirection"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Writing direction defines the base direction in which bidirectional text","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lays out its directional runs. A directional run is a contiguous sequence","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of characters that all have the same effective directionality, which can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"be determined using the Unicode BiDi algorithm. The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/leftToRight","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"writing direction puts the directional run that is placed first in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"storage leftmost, and places subsequent directional runs towards the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"right. The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/rightToLeft","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" writing direction puts the directional run","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that is placed first in the storage rightmost, and places subsequent","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"directional runs towards the left.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Note that writing direction is a property separate from a text’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"alignment, its line layout direction, or its character direction.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However, it is often used to determine the default alignment of a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"paragraph. E.g. English (a language with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/leftToRight","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Locale\/Language-swift.struct\/characterDirection","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") is usually aligned","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the left, but may be centered or aligned to the right for special","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"effect, or to be visually more appealing in a user interface.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For bidirectional text to be perceived as laid out correctly, make sure","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that the writing direction is set to the value equivalent to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Locale\/Language-swift.struct\/characterDirection","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of the primary","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"language in the text. E.g. an English sentence that contains some","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Arabic (a language with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/rightToLeft","type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Locale\/Language-swift.struct\/characterDirection","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") words, should use","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/leftToRight","type":"reference"},{"text":" writing direction. An Arabic sentence that contains","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"some English words, should use a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/rightToLeft","type":"reference"},{"text":" writing direction.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Writing direction is always orthogonoal to the line layout direction","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"chosen to display a certain text. The line layout direction is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"direction in which a sequence of lines is placed in. E.g. English text","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is usually displayed with a line layout direction of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/topToBottom","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". While languages do","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"have an associated line language direction (see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Locale\/Language-swift.struct\/lineLayoutDirection","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), not all displays","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of text follow the line layout direction of the text’s primary language.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Horizontal script is script with a line layout direction of either","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/topToBottom","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/bottomToTop","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":". Vertical script","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"has a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/leftToRight","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/rightToLeft","type":"reference"},{"text":" line layout","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"direction. In vertical scripts, a writing direction of ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/leftToRight","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is interpreted as top-to-bottom and a writing direction of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/rightToLeft","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is interpreted as bottom-to-top."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"references":{"doc://FoundationEssentials/documentation/FoundationEssentials/AttributedString/UTF16View":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UTF16View","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"UTF16View","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A view of an attributed string’s contents as a collection of UTF-16 code units."}],"url":"\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/attributedstring\/utf16view","title":"AttributedString.UTF16View","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/UTF16View","type":"topic"},"doc://FoundationEssentials/s15BitwiseCopyableP":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.BitwiseCopyable","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s15BitwiseCopyableP"},"doc://FoundationEssentials/documentation/FoundationEssentials/AttributedString":{"title":"AttributedString","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/attributedstring","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AttributedString","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString","abstract":[{"text":"A value type for a st